Today we learn about Online Community Guidelines. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:24.820
Community guideline. Say it with me. Community guideline!

6
00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:32.226
Rule. Say it with me. Rule!

7
00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:41.367
Respectful behavior. Say it with me. Respectful behavior!

8
00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:48.968
Moderator. Say it with me. Moderator!

9
00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:56.350
Report. Say it with me. Report!

10
00:00:59.854 --> 00:01:04.439
Safe space. Say it with me. Safe space!

11
00:01:07.948 --> 00:01:12.371
Enforce. Say it with me. Enforce!

12
00:01:15.881 --> 00:01:21.131
Online platform. Say it with me. Online platform!

13
00:01:24.592 --> 00:01:36.113
Online community guidelines set rules for respectful behavior on a platform. A moderator can enforce these rules, and I can report a violation to keep it a safe space.

14
00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:39.892
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:40.932 --> 00:01:46.530
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.495
Respectful behavior!

17
00:01:49.414 --> 00:01:55.081
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:55.131 --> 00:01:56.322
Enforce!

19
00:01:57.597 --> 00:02:07.282
Did you know? Community guidelines help millions of people from different backgrounds interact safely on the very same online platform!

20
00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:09.730
